    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "SES is being developed as an interactive server-client web expert system for structural geology. It is an integrated system combining a logical engine, a knowledge base, a database, web portals with html dynamic pages and program executables. This system is developed using state of the art artificial intelligence technology. The audience for SES ranges from undergraduate students to specialists in many applied geological disciplines. For personnel in the oil business, SES can provide an excellent tool for reservoir characterization and an aid wherever decisions and workflow are dependent on any structural geology problem.",
